{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "0faf96dd-3f9b-4383-a79b-7939add6e758",
    "name": "BookDemo",
    "description": "# BookDemo API\n\nA layered ASP.NET Core Web API for managing books, built as a  \nportfolio project demonstrating Clean Architecture, JWT authentication,  \nAPI versioning, HATEOAS, and caching strategies.\n\n## Base URL\n\n`{{baseURL}}` — see the environment variable for the active value  \n(`https://localhost:7093` in Development).\n\n## Authentication\n\nMost write operations require a Bearer JWT. Obtain one via  \n`POST /api/auth/login`, then set it as the `token` variable or paste it  \ninto the collection's Authorization tab.\n\n## API Versions\n\n- **v1**: original endpoint set\n    \n- **v2**: adds \\[describe what's new in V2, e.g. extended DTOs\\]\n    \n\nInteractive OpenAPI documentation is also available at `/scalar` when  \nrunning the API locally.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "51403560"
  },
